Further development of the 3.8.x line was published as MyBrowser by
xixiranran (https://github.com/xixiranran/MyChrome), from whose 3.8.50 release
the source in src/MyBrowser.au3 was recovered.

This fork (3.9.x) is distributed under the same licence, GPL-3.0. See LICENSE.
The complete corresponding source is in this repository.

Bundled third-party components, each under its own licence:

  resources/7z.exe, resources/7z.dll      7-Zip, GNU LGPL / unRAR restriction
  resources/GreenChrome*.dll, setdll*.exe GreenChrome / Microsoft setdll
  resources/mozlz4-*.exe                  MozLz4, MPL-2.0
  resources/MouseInc.*, hook*.dll         MouseInc
  resources/TabPlus.*                     TabPlus

Chrome, Chromium, Edge, Brave, Firefox, Vivaldi and Cent are downloaded at
runtime from their vendors and are not distributed with this program.
